  "limitations": [
    "The speaker-disjoint folds use train-only inferred pseudo-speaker clusters rather than supplied ground-truth speaker identities.",
    "Scorer robustness covers seeds 13, 53, and 97, but each fold has one fixed-seed CTC fit; CTC training-seed variance was not measured.",
    "The training labels are strongly imbalanced: counts are 10668, 6875, and 69700 for labels 0, 1, and 2.",
    "Prompt purging guarantees zero held-prompt overlap, but reduces each fold's fit set to between 1288 and 1373 records.",
    "Final validation contains 100 utterances and 2996 phones from one held manifest; no external corpus was evaluated.",
    "The fixed retrain is one seed-42 checkpoint.",
    "The accepted trade-off improves balanced MAE and rare-label recall while slightly worsening MAE, QWK, label-2 recall, and continuous ECE; every change stayed inside the predeclared guardrails."
  ]
